93040 - use wand of teleport to escape plane of air. Engulfed once.

93254 - arrive Astral plane.

I almost get killed several times on the Astral plane.

The first thing I do is swap my speed boots for jump boots and use both
inherent light and wand to light area.  I decide to go up the middle to
take on Pestilence with the 3 wands of death I am holding.
He gets next to me -- I try to jump --

"your boots lack traction"

WHAT??? I can't jump?  Caught between creatures I'm in trouble!

After the game,  I realize I forgot to take off my ring of levitation
and that's why I couldn't jump.  But at the time, things were scary!

Pestilence gets close enough to touch me.   I am ill.  I am worried,
but I zap him with a wand of death and put him down. I then cure myself
with a potion of extra healing.  Not understanding the problem with my
boots, I  put my speed boots back on and stick with them for the rest
of the game.

Fight my way up through the center. Twice I lose more than a hundred
hit points and quaff potions of full healing.   After this I am in no
more danger from physical attack.  I go up the middle and reach the
center altar.

Neutral.  Dag blast it.

Come back the other way, knocking pestilence down with WoD on my way
out.

Go left this time. My guardian angel goes down fighting valiantly
somewhere in the middle passage.  Encounter famine.

Things get scary, as an umber hulk confuses me and my movement puts me
next to Famine instead of away, which is what I intended.  He reaches
out to touch me, but I take no hurt ... must be too full. I'm in real
danger here.

Still, I'm in trouble here.  He's next to me, and I'm confused. If I
shoot, there's a good chance I'll shoot the wrong way.  I take a chance
-- yes!  Zap him!   With him out of the way I push through to the left
temple.

Chaotic.  Double darn.

Back the other way, killing the umber hulk on the way. Blindfolded this
time so he can't confuse me.

Knock down pestilence on the way.   Have burned through two wands of
death, but I get a fourth one from a robber in front of the left
temple. He zaps me with it, but it bounces off my reflection and kills
him instead.  I gratefully scoop it up.

For the third time, I almost get killed .. I feel hungry walking across
the floor, so I pull out my K-rations to eat a few.

The second one I eat causes me to faint.

NOOOOO.

Then pestilence comes over and touches me while I'm fainted.  I feel
ill.

Double NOOOO.   Things look really scary, but I regain consciousness.
I quickly zap Pestilence, and quaff my second potion of extra healing.
"Feel much better.." .. PHEW!

Continue right and see death.  Having learned my lesson, I pull out my
13 blessed +2 daggers and start salvoing them at him from long range.
I kill him, but enemy priests pick up some of them, and I am only able
to recover 8.  I don't care ... I keep heading right, through the mob
into the rightmost temple where I FINALLY find the lawful altar.

